1
00:00:00,972 --> 00:00:03,222
As Uke comes round to grab both shoulders

2
00:00:03,523 --> 00:00:04,704
draw him towards you

3
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:07,313
as he comes round to grab the other shoulder

4
00:00:07,314 --> 00:00:11,196
take a big step forward
moving his body completely around your body,

5
00:00:11,597 --> 00:00:13,644
cut down controlling his wrist

6
00:00:14,045 --> 00:00:16,133
as he come around turn sharply,

7
00:00:16,134 --> 00:00:18,590
control his wrist and cut down towards the mat,

8
00:00:19,291 --> 00:00:22,439
controlling his wrist and arm
come round to his front,

9
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,082
sit down controlling his shoulder,

10
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:27,548
place his shoulder again
in between your knees,

11
00:00:29,249 --> 00:00:33,056
as you do so bring his wrist
towards your shoulder,

12
00:00:33,057 --> 00:00:34,185
controlling his arm

13
00:00:34,186 --> 00:00:35,206
holding him tightly,

14
00:00:35,207 --> 00:00:38,045
turn the body towards his head for the pin.

